### A.5 Further Research Tasks for the Agent

The agent should additionally investigate:

- [ ] Whether Singapore's 1 Dec rules apply to **gig-economy delivery riders** (GrabFood, Foodpanda, Deliveroo)
- [ ] Whether **migrant worker dormitory transit** (walking to sites) counts as "outdoor work"
- [ ] How Singapore's rules interact with **HDB BTO construction timelines** and productivity targets
- [ ] Whether **insurance premiums** in Singapore's construction sector are adjusted for heat compliance
- [ ] Whether Singapore has a **national heat-health alert system** integrated with workplace scheduling
- [ ] How Singapore's rules compare to **Qatar's 2022 World Cup worker protections** (supervisor-to-worker ratio, hydration stations)
- [ ] Whether the **Singapore Green Plan 2030** intersects with occupational heat adaptation
- [ ] Whether **Tripartite Partners (MOM, NTUC, SNEF)** issued joint guidance on heat stress
- [ ] Whether **Workers' Compensation insurance** in Singapore covers heat illness explicitly
- [ ] Whether Singapore's rules account for **PPE heat burden** (e.g., full-body harnesses, hard hats increasing thermal load)

